{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓團BLACK PINK成員Lisa近日忙於演出美國拉斯維加斯的駐場騷《VIVA LA LISA》，其中一場演出中，身旁舞蹈員為Lisa脫下裙身時，差點連其入面的貼身熱褲也扯下，險走光的Lisa卻處變不驚，絲毫未受影響，繼續淡定表演，獲粉絲</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T02:06:31.485269+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T01:56:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T01:59:50.281184+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T01:59:50.281184+00:00","content_hash":"69eb20009d5ef2933c03fa79d87a74455e4767b65b2bbdf80f451eb1294d4270","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}